          "number": 2,
          "letter": "",
          "english": "Locked indoors, unable to get on their bicycles and hang out with their friends, teens have turned to social media and their mobile phones to socialize with their peers. What they do online often __(27)__ what they might otherwise do if their mobility weren't so heavily __(28)__ in the age of helicopter parenting. Social media and smart-phone apps have become so popular in recent years because teens need a place to call their own. They want the freedom to __(29)__ their identity and the world around them. Instead of __(30)__ out, they jump online.",
